Project KONSINYASI {
  database_type: "PostgreSQL"
  Note: "DBML v1.4 - DESAIN ULANG PENUH (blueprint sebelum migration diterapkan). Mencakup WORKFLOW 1 (Serah Terima Muatan / Surat Jalan Gudang<->Sales), WORKFLOW 2 (Kunjungan Outlet: LUNAS & KONSINYASI), domain TRANSACTIONS & TRANSACTION_ITEMS (header + item untuk laporan, histori, dokumen, rekonsiliasi pembayaran, dan fondasi accounting), AUDIT REJECTED CHECK-IN (visit_checkin_attempts), serta konvensi infrastruktur (RLS, idempotency, anti negative stock, race safety). v1.4 menyelesaikan gap hasil FINAL TECHNICAL AUDIT: F1 (satu active visit per Sales) & F4 (audit rejected check-in). Status: READY FOR REVIEW -- BUKAN READY FOR MIGRATION."
}

// =====================================================================
// PENYELARASAN DENGAN RUNTIME EXISTING (baca dulu sebelum migrasi)
// =====================================================================
// 1. Identitas: auth.users adalah sumber kebenaran. `distributors.id = auth.users.id`;
//    `users` = profil/klaim aplikasi yang menceminkan JWT app_metadata (role + distributor_id)
//    yang dibaca getUserRole/getDistributorId di server.
// 2. Semua tulis dipaksa lewat RPC SECURITY DEFINER yang GRANT-nya hanya service_role
//    (pola sama seperti assign_outlet_to_rute / receive_mitra_shipment di migrasi lama).
// 3. Nama tabel struktur dipertahankan agar server/routers.ts tidak banyak berubah.
//    PERUBAHAN NAMA/ADJUSTMENT vs DB live (perlu ALTER saat migrasi, belum dieksekusi):
//    a) distributor_stock.available_quantity  -> distributor_stock.quantity (decimal(18,3)).
//    b) outlet.is_active                      -> outlets.status (enum ACTIVE/INACTIVE).
//    c) distributor_stock.quantity dikunci non-negatif (CHECK quantity >= 0). DB live masih integer.
// 4. Perbaikan bug migrasi 20260915595958:
//    (a) rute_sales_assignments.sales_id -> users.id (jangan self-reference).
//    (b) partial unique index memakai `where ended_at is null` (bukan is_active).
// 5. Tidak ada DELETE/DROP di domain bisnis; penonaktifan = status atau ended_at.
// 6. ALUR STOK YANG BENAR (wajib):
//    GUDANG --SJ GUDANG_TO_SALES--> SALES STOCK --VISIT (add/restock)--> OUTLET STOCK --SALES_OUT--> (terjual)
//    OUTLET STOCK --RETURN--> SALES STOCK --SJ SALES_TO_GUDANG--> GUDANG
//    Distributor (gudang) HANYA berubah lewat Surat Jalan yang sudah COMPLETED, dengan final_qty.

// =====================================================================
// ENUM
// =====================================================================
Enum user_role {
  DISTRIBUTOR
  ADMIN
  SALES_MOTORIS
  HRD
  SUPERVISOR
  MITRA_UMKM
  PLATFORM_SYS_ADMIN
}

Enum outlet_status {
  ACTIVE
  INACTIVE
}

Enum sj_direction {
  GUDANG_TO_SALES
  SALES_TO_GUDANG
}

Enum sj_status {
  DRAFT
  READY
  CHECKED
  DISCREPANCY
  CONFIRMED
  RETURN_CONFIRMED
  COMPLETED
  CANCELLED
}

Enum sj_movement_type {
  SJ_OUT
  SJ_RETURN
}

Enum visit_status {
  DRAFT
  CHECKED_IN
  FINALIZED
  CANCELLED
}

Enum checkin_attempt_status {
  REJECTED
}

Enum card_status {
  DRAFT
  APPLIED
}

Enum visit_condition {
  TOKO_BARU
  TOKO_BUKA
  TOKO_TUTUP
  MASIH_STOK
  TOKO_NONAKTIF
}

Enum transaction_status {
  LUNAS
  KONSINYASI
}

Enum payment_status {
  LUNAS
  SEBAGIAN
  PIUTANG
}

Enum payment_method {
  CASH
  TRANSFER
  QRIS
  LAINNYA
}

Enum receivable_status {
  OPEN
  PARTIAL
  PAID
}

Enum ownership_type {
  KONSINYASI
  MILIK_OUTLET
}

// movement type UNTUK DOMAIN KUNJUNGAN (domain SJ memakai sj_movement_type terpisah)
Enum movement_type {
  ADD_IN
  RESTOCK_IN
  SALES_OUT
  RETURN_OUT
  OWNERSHIP_TRANSFER
}

Enum document_type {
  STRUK_LUNAS
  STRUK_SERAH_TERIMA
  STRUK_KONSINYASI
  NOTA_KONSINYASI_NONAKTIF
  SURAT_JALAN
  KWITANSI
  INVOICE
  LAINNYA
}

Enum photo_type {
  FOTO_DEPAN_OUTLET
  FOTO_PRODUK
  FOTO_AKHIR
  LAINNYA
}

Enum event_type {
  VISIT_CREATED
  VISIT_CHECKED_IN
  CARD_APPLIED
  VISIT_FINALIZED
  VISIT_CANCELLED
  PAYMENT_RECORDED
  RECEIVABLE_SETTLED
}

Enum sj_event_type {
  SJ_CREATED
  SJ_READY
  SJ_CHECKED
  SJ_DISCREPANCY
  SJ_CONFIRMED
  SJ_RETURN_CONFIRMED
  SJ_COMPLETED
  SJ_CANCELLED
}

// =====================================================================
// 1. ORGANISASI / USER / ROLE
// =====================================================================
Table distributors {
  id uuid [pk, ref: > auth.users.id]
  name varchar [not null]
  code varchar [unique]
  is_active boolean [not null, default: true]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]
}

Table users {
  id uuid [pk, ref: > auth.users.id]
  distributor_id uuid [ref: > distributors.id]
  name varchar [not null]
  email varchar
  phone varchar
  role user_role [not null]  // disimpan sebagai varchar; cermin JWT app_metadata.role
  is_active boolean [not null, default: true]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (distributor_id, role)
  }

  Note: "Profil aplikasi. role & distributor_id di tabel ini sumber admin-managed; runtime tetap memakai JWT app_metadata."
}

// =====================================================================
// 2. WILAYAH / RUTE
// =====================================================================
Table wilayah {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  kode varchar [not null]
  nama varchar [not null]
  keterangan text
  is_active boolean [not null, default: true]
  created_by uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (distributor_id, kode) [unique]
    (distributor_id, is_active)
  }
}

Table rute {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  wilayah_id uuid [not null, ref: > wilayah.id]
  kode varchar [not null]
  nama varchar [not null]
  keterangan text
  is_active boolean [not null, default: true]
  created_by uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (distributor_id, kode) [unique]
    (distributor_id, wilayah_id, is_active)
  }
}

// =====================================================================
// 3. OUTLET (lifecycle terpisah dari condition pada product card)
// =====================================================================
Table outlets {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  kode varchar [not null]
  nama varchar [not null]
  nama_pemilik varchar
  no_hp varchar
  alamat text
  latitude decimal(10,7)
  longitude decimal(10,7)
  gps_radius_m integer [not null, default: 100]
  status outlet_status [not null, default: ACTIVE]  // lifecycle outlet; BUKAN condition product card
  foto_depan_url text  // storage bucket outlet-photos (FOTO_DEPAN_OUTLET)
  created_by uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (distributor_id, kode) [unique]
    (distributor_id, status)
  }

  Note: "outlets.status = lifecycle status outlet. TIDAK identik dengan condition di visit_product_cards (mis. outlets.status=ACTIVE bisa memiliki card condition TOKO_TUTUP/MASIH_STOK/TOKO_NONAKTIF di visit tertentu). Selalu dievaluasi terpisah, tidak disinkronkan otomatis."
}

// =====================================================================
// 4. ASSIGNMENT (Admin menentukan Sales & Outlet melalui Rute)
// =====================================================================
Table rute_outlet_assignments {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  rute_id uuid [not null, ref: > rute.id]
  outlet_id uuid [not null, ref: > outlets.id]
  assigned_at timestamptz [not null]
  ended_at timestamptz  // null = aktif
  assigned_by uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (distributor_id, outlet_id) [unique]  // partial: where ended_at is null
    (distributor_id, rute_id)
  }

  Note: "Satu OUTLET satu assignment aktif. Reassign = tutup lama + buka baru + tulis assignment_history."
}

Table rute_sales_assignments {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  rute_id uuid [not null, ref: > rute.id]
  sales_id uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]  // BENAR: ke users; bukan self-reference
  assigned_at timestamptz [not null]
  ended_at timestamptz  // null = aktif
  assigned_by uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (distributor_id, sales_id) [unique]  // partial: where ended_at is null
    (distributor_id, rute_id)
  }

  Note: "Sales TIDAK memilih rute/outlet sendiri. Pemicu validitas kunjungan & muatan: sales harus punya assignment aktif (ended_at null) di rute tsb."
}

Table assignment_history {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  entity_type varchar [not null]  // OUTLET / SALES
  entity_id uuid [not null]
  from_rute_id uuid [ref: > rute.id]
  to_rute_id uuid [ref: > rute.id]
  action varchar [not null]  // ASSIGN / REASSIGN / UNASSIGN
  changed_by uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  changed_at timestamptz [not null]
  metadata jsonb [not null, default: "{}"]

  indexes {
    (distributor_id, entity_type, entity_id, changed_at)
    (distributor_id, to_rute_id, changed_at)
    (distributor_id, from_rute_id, changed_at)
  }

  Note: "Append-only; audit untuk assignment. Audit kunjungan memakai visit_events; audit Surat Jalan memakai surat_jalan_events."
}

// =====================================================================
// 5. PRODUK (master; kartu produk = referensi + snapshot)
// =====================================================================
Table products {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  sku varchar [not null]
  name varchar [not null]
  unit varchar
  category varchar
  size varchar
  selling_price decimal(18,2) [not null, default: 0]
  is_active boolean [not null, default: true]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (distributor_id, sku) [unique]
  }

  Note: "RLS dipastikan: distributor, admin, dan SALES_MOTORIS tenant tsb wajib bisa SELECT (untuk kartu produk & muatan)."
}

// =====================================================================
// 6. STOK GUDANG (DISTRIBUTOR)
// GUDANG HANYA BERUBAH MELALUI SURAT JALAN YANG SUDAH COMPLETED.
// =====================================================================
Table distributor_stock {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  product_id uuid [not null, ref: > products.id]
  quantity decimal(18,3) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (quantity >= 0)
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (distributor_id, product_id) [unique]
  }

  Note: "Stok gudang. PERUBAHAN NAMA: available_quantity -> quantity. KONSTRAINT: CHECK (quantity >= 0). HANYA RPC serah terima (SJ GUDANG_TO_SALES/SALES_TO_GUDANG) yang boleh men-debit/kredit; finalize_visit TIDAK menyentuh tabel ini."
}

// =====================================================================
// 7. SALES STOCK (MUATAN SALES)
// Hasil final accepted quantity SJ GUDANG -> SALES. Sumber stok untuk kunjungan.
// =====================================================================
Table sales_stock {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  sales_id uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  product_id uuid [not null, ref: > products.id]
  quantity decimal(18,3) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (quantity >= 0)
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (sales_id, product_id) [unique]
    (distributor_id, product_id)
  }

  Note: "Muatan yang dibawa Sales. Alur: GUDANG -> SJ GUDANG_TO_SALES -> final accepted qty -> SALES STOCK. Debit saat kunjungan memakai restock_qty/add_qty dan saat return SJ SALES_TO_GUDANG. KONSTRAINT: CHECK (quantity >= 0)."
}

// =====================================================================
// 8. STOK OUTLET (ownership)
// =====================================================================
Table outlet_stock {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  outlet_id uuid [not null, ref: > outlets.id]
  product_id uuid [not null, ref: > products.id]
  quantity decimal(18,3) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (quantity >= 0)
  ownership_type ownership_type [not null]
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (outlet_id, product_id, ownership_type) [unique]
    (distributor_id, product_id)
  }

  Note: "KONSINYASI = titipan distributor di outlet (belum terjual/belum dibeli lunas). MILIK_OUTLET = barang yang telah dibeli LUNAS dan menjadi milik outlet — berlaku untuk TOKO_BARU LUNAS, TOKO_BUKA LUNAS, dan sisa TOKO_NONAKTIF. Sumber: SALES STOCK -> KUNJUNGAN -> OUTLET STOCK. KONSTRAINT: CHECK (quantity >= 0)."
}

// =====================================================================
// 9. SURAT JALAN (WORKFLOW 1 - SERAH TERIMA MUATAN)
// =====================================================================
Table surat_jalan {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  sj_number varchar [not null]
  direction sj_direction [not null]
  sales_id uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  status sj_status [not null, default: DRAFT]
  sj_date date [not null]
  notes text
  // discrepancy / resolution metadata (aggreagate header; rincian di item)
  has_discrepancy boolean [not null, default: false]
  resolved_by uuid [ref: > users.id]
  resolved_at timestamptz
  confirmed_at timestamptz  // saat CONFIRMED / RETURN_CONFIRMED
  completed_at timestamptz  // saat COMPLETED (transfer stok dieksekusi)
  cancelled_at timestamptz
  created_by uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (distributor_id, sj_number) [unique]
    (sales_id, sj_date)
    (distributor_id, status)
  }

  Note: "STATUS MACHINE GUDANG_TO_SALES: DRAFT -> READY -> CHECKED -> (DISCREPANCY -> CONFIRMED) -> COMPLETED. SALES_TO_GUDANG: DRAFT -> READY -> CHECKED -> (DISCREPANCY -> RETURN_CONFIRMED) -> COMPLETED. CANCELLED tersedia di kedua arah. STOK TIDAK BERUBAH pada DRAFT/READY/CHECKED/DISCREPANCY. Transfer stok hanya dieksekusi pada transisi ke COMPLETED dan hanya memakai final_qty."
}

Table surat_jalan_items {
  id uuid [pk]
  surat_jalan_id uuid [not null, ref: > surat_jalan.id]
  product_id uuid [not null, ref: > products.id]
  expected_qty decimal(18,3) [not null, default: 0]  // GUDANG_TO_SALES: qty dikirim Gudang; SALES_TO_GUDANG: qty yang seharusnya dikembalikan
  actual_qty decimal(18,3)  // GUDANG_TO_SALES: qty yang diterima Sales (setelah checking)
  physical_check_qty decimal(18,3)  // SALES_TO_GUDANG: hasil pemeriksaan fisik oleh Gudang/Admin
  final_qty decimal(18,3)  // qty final yang disetujui; NULL sampai CONFIRMED/RETURN_CONFIRMED
  is_discrepancy boolean [not null, default: false]
  discrepancy_reason text  // WAJIB saat actual/physical != expected (dipaksa RPC save/check)
  resolved_by uuid [ref: > users.id]
  resolved_at timestamptz
  created_at timestamptz [not null]
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (surat_jalan_id, product_id) [unique]
    (product_id)
  }

  Note: "GUDANG_TO_SALES: expected = dikirim Gudang, actual = diterima Sales, final = disetujui setelah checking/discrepancy. SALES_TO_GUDANG: expected = seharusnya kembali, physical_check = pemeriksaan fisik, final = diterima Gudang. is_discrepancy=true wajib punya discrepancy_reason; hanya Admin/Resolve yang boleh mengisi resolved_by/resolved_at dan final_qty."
}

// =====================================================================
// 10. STOCK MOVEMENT SURAT JALAN (ledger idempoten - anti double transfer SJ)
// =====================================================================
Table surat_jalan_stock_movements {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  surat_jalan_id uuid [not null, ref: > surat_jalan.id]
  surat_jalan_item_id uuid [not null, ref: > surat_jalan_items.id]
  product_id uuid [not null, ref: > products.id]
  movement_type sj_movement_type [not null]
  quantity decimal(18,3) [not null]  // > 0; memakai final_qty item
  prev_source_stock decimal(18,3)
  prev_target_stock decimal(18,3)
  note text
  posted_by uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (surat_jalan_id, surat_jalan_item_id, movement_type) [unique]  // ANTI DOUBLE TRANSFER SJ
    (distributor_id, product_id, created_at)
    (surat_jalan_id)
  }

  Note: "Ditulis HANYA ketika SJ transisi ke COMPLETED, menggunakan final_qty, dalam satu transaksi bersama update distributor_stock & sales_stock. SJ_OUT = Gudang -> Sales (distributor_stock -, sales_stock +); SJ_RETURN = Sales -> Gudang (sales_stock -, distributor_stock +). unique(surat_jalan_id, surat_jalan_item_id, movement_type) membuat posting ulang tidak mungkin. Pemisahan dari domain visit (visit_stock_movements) sesuai kebutuhan idempotency terpisah."
}

// =====================================================================
// 11. AUDIT SURAT JALAN
// =====================================================================
Table surat_jalan_events {
  id uuid [pk]
  surat_jalan_id uuid [not null, ref: > surat_jalan.id]
  event_type sj_event_type [not null]
  actor_id uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  metadata jsonb [not null, default: "{}"]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (surat_jalan_id, created_at)
  }

  Note: "Append-only; jejak status machine SJ (dibuat, ready, checked, discrepancy, confirm, complete, cancel)."
}

// =====================================================================
// 12. KUNJUNGAN OUTLET (WORKFLOW 2)
// =====================================================================
Table visits {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  outlet_id uuid [not null, ref: > outlets.id]
  sales_id uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  rute_id uuid [not null, ref: > rute.id]
  visit_date date [not null]
  status visit_status [not null, default: DRAFT]
  transaction_status transaction_status  // LUNAS / KONSINYASI; diisi saat kartu diproses
  checkin_at timestamptz
  checkin_latitude decimal(10,7)
  checkin_longitude decimal(10,7)
  checkout_at timestamptz
  notes text
  finalized_at timestamptz
  finalized_by uuid [ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (sales_id, visit_date)
    (outlet_id, visit_date)
    (distributor_id, status)
    // PARTIAL UNIQUE (distributor_id, sales_id) WHERE status IN ('DRAFT','CHECKED_IN') - REQUIRES SQL IMPLEMENTATION
  }

  Note: "Status: DRAFT -> CHECKED_IN -> FINALIZED (irreversible), atau CANCELLED. Stok HANYA berubah saat transisi ke FINALIZED (RPC finalize_visit). Sales harus punya assignment aktif di rute tsb (trigger). Check-in memvalidasi jarak ke koordinat outlet (gps_radius_m). transaction_status bersifat per visit; condition tetap per product card."
  Note: "F1 - SATU SALES MAKSIMAL SATU ACTIVE VISIT: seorang Sales hanya boleh memiliki maksimal satu visit berstatus DRAFT atau CHECKED_IN pada satu waktu. FINALIZED dan CANCELLED BUKAN active visit (tidak dihitung). CONSTRAINT: PARTIAL UNIQUE INDEX (distributor_id, sales_id) WHERE status IN ('DRAFT','CHECKED_IN') [REQUIRES SQL IMPLEMENTATION - tidak representable di DBML; harus ditulis di migration]. Partial index hanya mengunci baris berstatus active, sehingga TIDAK menghalangi visit FINALIZED/CANCELLED maupun pembuatan visit berikutnya setelah visit sebelumnya selesai."
  Note: "CHECK-IN GAGAL/REJECTED BUKAN visit: check-in yang ditolak validasi GPS tidak membuat baris visits; dicatat sebagai visit_checkin_attempts (lihat tabel berikut). visits.status TIDAK pernah berisi REJECTED."
}

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// F4 - CHECK-IN ATTEMPT (AUDIT REJECTED CHECK-IN)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
Table visit_checkin_attempts {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  sales_id uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  outlet_id uuid [not null, ref: > outlets.id]
  rute_id uuid [ref: > rute.id]  // nullable jika rute belum dapat ditentukan
  attempted_at timestamptz [not null]
  latitude decimal(10,7)
  longitude decimal(10,7)
  gps_radius_m integer [not null]
  distance_m decimal(10,2) [not null]
  rejection_reason text [not null]
  status checkin_attempt_status [not null, default: REJECTED]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (sales_id, attempted_at)
    (outlet_id, attempted_at)
    (distributor_id, attempted_at)
    (status, attempted_at)
  }

  Note: "F4 - AUDIT REJECTED CHECK-IN. Mencatat SETIAP percobaan check-in yang DITOLAK sebelum visit valid dibuat. REJECTED CHECK-IN BUKAN visits (tidak ada baris visits; visits.status tidak pernah REJECTED). ALUR: SALES -> REQUEST CHECK-IN -> GPS VALIDATION -> [VALID] CREATE VISIT (CHECKED_IN) / [INVALID] CREATE CHECK-IN ATTEMPT (REJECTED/AUDIT)."
  Note: "TENANT & RLS: distributor_id konsisten (FK ke distributors.id); sales_id ke users.id; outlet_id ke outlets.id; rute_id NULLABLE ke rute.id (diisi bila dapat ditentukan dari assignment aktif sales). Ditulis HANYA via RPC checkin_validate (service_role). RLS: distributor/admin baca seluruh ruang kerja; sales baca attempt miliknya."
}

// =====================================================================
// 13. KARTU PRODUK (SATU VISIT -> BANYAK CARD; TIAP CARD KONDISI SENDIRI)
// =====================================================================
Table visit_product_cards {
  id uuid [pk]
  visit_id uuid [not null, ref: > visits.id]
  product_id uuid [not null, ref: > products.id]
  status card_status [not null, default: DRAFT]
  condition visit_condition [not null]

  // STOCK
  stock_before decimal(18,3) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (>= 0)
  physical_check decimal(18,3) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (>= 0)
  add_qty decimal(18,3) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (>= 0)
  restock_qty decimal(18,3) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (>= 0)
  old_sales_qty decimal(18,3) [not null, default: 0]  // laku lama = stock_before - physical_check (utk Toko Buka KONSINYASI)
  sales_qty decimal(18,3) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (>= 0)
  return_qty decimal(18,3) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (>= 0)
  stock_after decimal(18,3) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (>= 0)

  // PRICE & PAYMENT (snapshot harga saat kunjungan)
  selling_price decimal(18,2) [not null, default: 0]
  payment_status payment_status  // LUNAS / SEBAGIAN / PIUTANG; utk LUNAS selalu LUNAS
  amount_due decimal(18,2) [not null, default: 0]   // total transaksi kartu (biasanya sales_qty * selling_price)
  amount_paid decimal(18,2) [not null, default: 0]  // jumlah dibayar di visit

  // ALASAN (WAJIB utk TOKO_TUTUP & TOKO_NONAKTIF)
  alasan text

  created_at timestamptz [not null]
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (visit_id)
    (product_id, condition)
  }

  Note: "RUMUS & ATURAN PER KONDISI - STATUS LUNAS: (1) TOKO_BARU: stock_before=0, physical=0, add=Qty beli (dari sales_stock), sales=add, restock=0, return=0, stock_after=add_qty, 100% LUNAS, barang menjadi MILIK_OUTLET, foto produk wajib, STRUK_LUNAS. (2) TOKO_BUKA: stock_before auto, physical input, restock input (dari sales_stock), sales input, return=0, stock_after = physical_check + restock_qty - sales_qty, 100% LUNAS, barang MILIK_OUTLET, foto produk wajib, STRUK_LUNAS. (3) TOKO_TUTUP: tanpa sales/restock/return, stok tidak berubah (stock_after=stock_before), alasan wajib, foto akhir wajib, TIDAK ada struk lunas. (4) MASIH_STOK: tanpa sales/restock/return, stok tidak berubah, foto produk wajib, foto akhir wajib. (5) TOKO_NONAKTIF: cek fisik, restok (dari sales_stock), penjualan, retur=0, 100% LUNAS, sisa menjadi MILIK_OUTLET (ownership transfer), alasan wajib, foto produk wajib, foto akhir wajib, TIDAK ada struk lunas."
  Note: "RUMUS & ATURAN PER KONDISI - STATUS KONSINYASI: (1) TOKO_BARU: stock_before=0, physical=0, add input Sales, restock=0, laku lama=0, return=0, stock_after=add_qty, foto produk wajib, STRUK_SERAH_TERIMA. (2) TOKO_BUKA: add=0, laku lama AUTO = stock_before - physical_check, restock input, retur input, stock_after = stock_before - laku_lama + restock_qty - return_qty, pembayaran LUNAS/SEBAGIAN/PIUTANG. (3) TOKO_TUTUP: stok tidak berubah, alasan wajib, foto akhir wajib, tanpa transaksi. (4) MASIH_STOK: physical=0, add=0, restock=0, laku=0, retur=0, stok tidak berubah, foto produk wajib, foto akhir wajib. (5) TOKO_NONAKTIF: cek fisik, laku lama, restok=0, sisa ditarik/retur, stock_after=0, pembayaran 100% LUNAS, foto produk wajib, alasan wajib, foto akhir wajib, NOTA_KONSINYASI_NONAKTIF wajib."
  Note: "PAYMENT INVARIANT: amount_paid + receivable_amount = amount_due. Utk wajib LUNAS: amount_paid = amount_due & receivable 0. SUMBER STOK: add/restock OPSIONAL hanya dari sales_stock (debit sales_stock, kredit outlet_stock); DISTRIBUTOR_STOCK TIDAK pernah disentuh di sini."
}

// =====================================================================
// 14. FOTO & DOKUMEN (storage bucket: visit-photos, visit-documents, outlet-photos)
// =====================================================================
Table visit_photos {
  id uuid [pk]
  visit_id uuid [not null, ref: > visits.id]
  card_id uuid [ref: > visit_product_cards.id]  // WAJIB utk FOTO_PRODUK; NULL utk FOTO_AKHIR
  photo_type photo_type [not null]
  photo_url text [not null]
  created_by uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (visit_id)
    (card_id)
  }

  Note: "FOTO_PRODUK wajib terikat ke product card (card_id NOT NULL); FOTO_AKHIR terikat ke visit (card_id NULL). FOTO_DEPAN_OUTLET disimpan di outlets.foto_depan_url (bucket outlet-photos). VALIDASI RPC finalize_visit: finalisasi WAJIB DITOLAK jika foto wajib (per kondisi di visit_product_cards) belum tersedia."
}

Table visit_documents {
  id uuid [pk]
  visit_id uuid [not null, ref: > visits.id]
  card_id uuid [ref: > visit_product_cards.id]
  transaction_id uuid [ref: > transactions.id]  // nullable; tautan opsional ke header transactions utk histori dokumen transaksi
  doc_type document_type [not null]
  file_url text [not null]
  note text
  created_by uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (visit_id)
    (card_id)
    (transaction_id)
  }

  Note: "STRUK_LUNAS (LUNAS Baru/Buka), STRUK_SERAH_TERIMA (Konsinyasi Baru), STRUK_KONSINYASI (Konsinyasi Buka), NOTA_KONSINYASI_NONAKTIF (Konsinyasi Nonaktif), SURAT_JALAN (lampiran dokumen SJ bila perlu). transaction_id (nullable) = tautan opsional ke transactions untuk kebutuhan histori/dokumen transaksi; hubungan existing ke visit & card TETAP dipertahankan."
}

// =====================================================================
// 15. PEMBAYARAN & PIUTANG
// =====================================================================
Table visit_payments {
  id uuid [pk]
  visit_id uuid [not null, ref: > visits.id]
  card_id uuid [not null, ref: > visit_product_cards.id]
  amount decimal(18,2) [not null]  // CHECK (amount > 0)
  method payment_method [not null]
  note text
  received_at timestamptz [not null]
  created_by uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (visit_id)
    (card_id)
  }

  Note: "Catatan penerimaan nyata. amount_paid per kartu = SUM(visit_payments.amount). Konsisten dengan invariant amount_paid + receivable = amount_due."
}

Table visit_receivables {
  id uuid [pk]
  visit_id uuid [not null, ref: > visits.id]
  card_id uuid [not null, ref: > visit_product_cards.id]
  amount decimal(18,2) [not null]  // CHECK (amount > 0)
  paid_amount decimal(18,2) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (paid_amount >= 0)
  status receivable_status [not null, default: OPEN]
due_date date  // nullable; TIDAK hardcoded (30 hari belum ditetapkan sebagai business rule). Isi sesuai aturan pembayaran yang ditetapkan.
    settled_at timestamptz
  created_by uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (status, due_date)
    (visit_id)
    (card_id)
  }

  Note: "Untuk KONSINYASI (TOKO_BUKA) dengan pembayaran SEBAGIAN / PIUTANG. Alur: transaction -> payment -> receivable -> settlement (RPC settle_receivable; catat visit_events). Invariant: paid_amount + receivable_amount = total_amount."
}

// =====================================================================
// 16. TRANSACTIONS & TRANSACTION ITEMS (HEADER/ITEM - LAPORAN & HISTORI)
// =====================================================================
Table transactions {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  visit_id uuid [not null, ref: > visits.id]
  transaction_number varchar [not null]  // generated idempotent oleh RPC; unik per tenant
  transaction_status transaction_status [not null]  // LUNAS / KONSINYASI; === visits.transaction_status
  transaction_date date [not null]  // diambil dari visits.visit_date
  total_amount decimal(18,2) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (total_amount >= 0)
  amount_paid decimal(18,2) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (amount_paid >= 0)
  receivable_amount decimal(18,2) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (receivable_amount >= 0)
  created_by uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]
  updated_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (distributor_id, transaction_number) [unique]  // nomor transaksi unik per tenant
    (visit_id)
    (distributor_id, transaction_date)
    (distributor_id, transaction_status)
  }

  Note: "HEADER TRANSAKSI per VISIT. Dibuat SATU transaksi per visit oleh RPC finalize_visit, HANYA bila visit memiliki minimal satu kartu penjualan (total_amount > 0) sesuai aturan TOKO_TUTUP & MASIH_STOK 'tanpa transaksi penjualan'. TRANSAKSI TANPA ITEM TIDAK DIPERKENANKAN. Semua nilai di sini adalah HEADER/SNAPSHOT laporan, BUKAN sumber kebenaran kedua."
  Note: "SOURCE OF TRUTH (tetap di domain existing): transaction_status === visits.transaction_status; total_amount = SUM(transaction_items.line_total) = SUM(visit_product_cards.amount_due) atas kartu yang ditagih; amount_paid = SUM(visit_payments.amount) untuk visit; receivable_amount = total_amount - amount_paid (rekonsiliasi dengan visit_receivables). INVARIANT: total_amount = amount_paid + receivable_amount. Rekonsiliasi diverifikasi di dalam finalize_visit."
  Note: "transaction_number dibuat idempotent oleh RPC (mis. urutan harian per distributor); unique(distributor_id, transaction_number) menjamin retry/posting ulang TIDAK menghasilkan nomor ganda. transaction_date mengikuti visits.visit_date (kejadian bisnis), created_at sebagai jejak pembuatan."
}

Table transaction_items {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]  // rantai tenant; WAJIB sama dgn transactions.distributor_id
  transaction_id uuid [not null, ref: > transactions.id]
  visit_product_card_id uuid [not null, ref: > visit_product_cards.id]  // relasi ke product card TIDAK dihilangkan
  product_id uuid [not null, ref: > products.id]  // snapshot/reference produk
  quantity decimal(18,3) [not null]  // CHECK (quantity > 0) - unit penjualan pada kartu terkait
  selling_price decimal(18,2) [not null]  // CHECK (selling_price >= 0)
  discount decimal(18,2) [not null, default: 0]  // CHECK (discount >= 0)
  line_total decimal(18,2) [not null]  // CHECK (line_total >= 0) = (quantity * selling_price) - discount
  created_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (transaction_id, visit_product_card_id) [unique]  // satu item per kartu per transaksi - anti duplikasi/idempotent
    (transaction_id)
    (product_id)
    (distributor_id, product_id, created_at)
  }

  Note: "SNAPSHOT/DETAIL per kartu penjualan pada transaksi untuk laporan & histori. BUKAN sumber kebenaran untuk condition/stock/amount. CONDITION SELALU berasal dari visit_product_cards.condition (single source of truth); TIDAK ada kolom condition di tabel ini. Quantity/valuasi mengikuti nilai pada kartu terkait; TIDAK menciptakan sumber stock baru. Satu item per kartu per transaksi (unique(transaction_id, visit_product_card_id))."
  Note: "FK RANTAI TENANT: distributor_id pada item === transactions.distributor_id === visits.distributor_id; hanya RPC finalize_visit (service_role) yang menulis dan memvalidasi rantai tenant sebelum INSERT, sehingga data distributor A mustahil menunjuk ke distributor B."
  Note: "TRACEABILITY: transaction -> visit (transactions.visit_id), transaction -> product card (transaction_items.visit_product_card_id), card -> product (visit_product_cards.product_id; snapshot transaction_items.product_id sebagai referensi)."
}

// =====================================================================
// 17. STOCK MOVEMENT KUNJUNGAN (ledger idempoten - anti double, domain visit)
// =====================================================================
Table visit_stock_movements {
  id uuid [pk]
  distributor_id uuid [not null, ref: > distributors.id]
  visit_id uuid [not null, ref: > visits.id]
  card_id uuid [not null, ref: > visit_product_cards.id]
  outlet_id uuid [not null, ref: > outlets.id]
  product_id uuid [not null, ref: > products.id]
  movement_type movement_type [not null]
  quantity decimal(18,3) [not null]  // CHECK (quantity > 0)
  prev_sales_stock decimal(18,3)
  prev_outlet_stock decimal(18,3)
  note text
  created_by uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (card_id, movement_type) [unique]  // ANTI DOUBLE STOCK MOVEMENT (VISIT)
    (distributor_id, outlet_id, product_id, created_at)
    (visit_id)
  }

  Note: "Ditulis hanya oleh RPC finalize_visit. PEMETAAN: ADD_IN & RESTOCK_IN = debit sales_stock, kredit outlet_stock (MILIK_OUTLET untuk LUNAS TOKO_BARU/TOKO_BUKA; KONSINYASI untuk KONSINYASI TOKO_BARU & restok TOKO_BUKA); SALES_OUT = debit outlet_stock (MILIK_OUTLET untuk LUNAS; KONSINYASI untuk KONSINYASI); RETURN_OUT = debit outlet_stock, kredit sales_stock (utk dibawa kembali ke gudang via SJ SALES_TO_GUDANG); OWNERSHIP_TRANSFER = ubah ownership_type KONSINYASI -> MILIK_OUTLET (non-aktif LUNAS, tanpa perubahan qty). unique(card_id, movement_type) mencegah posting ganda. Sumber kunjungan = SALES STOCK, BUKAN distributor_stock."
}

// =====================================================================
// 18. AUDIT KUNJUNGAN
// =====================================================================
Table visit_events {
  id uuid [pk]
  visit_id uuid [not null, ref: > visits.id]
  event_type event_type [not null]
  actor_id uuid [not null, ref: > users.id]
  metadata jsonb [not null, default: "{}"]
  created_at timestamptz [not null]

  indexes {
    (visit_id, created_at)
  }

  Note: "Append-only; jejak kunjungan (check-in, kartu diaplikasikan, finalisasi, pembayaran, pelunasan piutang)."
}

// =====================================================================
// RINGKASAN ATURAN (RLS, RPC, LOCKING, IDEMPOTENCY)
// =====================================================================
Note: "
ATURAN KETAT (RLS) - semua tulis lewat RPC SECURITY DEFINER, GRANT hanya service_role; SELECT tenant-scoped, distributor_id konsisten di seluruh tabel tenant:
- Distributor: baca seluruh ruang kerjanya.
- Admin: baca seluruh ruang kerja distributor_id dari JWT app_metadata; hak RESOLVE discrepancy SJ & final correction (tulis lewat RPC).
- Sales Motoris: hanya melihat data yang menjadi assignment-nya (melalui rute_sales_assignments aktif): visit miliknya, kartu visit miliknya, transaksi & item transaksi dari visit miliknya (read-only), visit_checkin_attempts miliknya (read-only), products & sales_stock ruang kerjanya, outlet milik rute yang dia pegang. Sales BISA membuat visit & input card (DRAFT/CHECKED_IN) serta checking SJ (actual/physical qty), TAPI TIDAK bisa mengubah master Wilayah/Rute, TIDAK bisa transfer stok SJ sebagai Admin, TIDAK bisa mem-bypass finalize.
- HRD/Supervisor: mode monitor (SELECT agregat).
- Transfer stok (SJ & visit) HANYA via RPC/service transaction yang aman.

RPC WAJIB (service_role only):
1. sj_create / sj_ready / sj_check (input actual/physical; auto-detect discrepancy; alasan wajib bila discrepancy)
2. sj_resolve (Admin: final correction -> final_qty; wajib ada discrepancy_reason bila discrepancy)
3. sj_confirm (CONFIRMED / RETURN_CONFIRMED)
4. sj_complete (COMPLETED; satu-satunya titik transfer stok Gudang<->Sales memakai final_qty; tulis surat_jalan_stock_movements)
5. finalize_visit (validasi status/card/alasan/foto/payment; sumber stok SALES STOCK -> OUTLET STOCK; tulis visit_stock_movements; buat/update transactions & transaction_items (header + snapshot item, idempotent) dalam transaksi yang sama; update sales_stock/outlet_stock; tulis payments/receivables; set FINALIZED)
6. settle_receivable (pembayaran piutang; VISIT: utk kunjungan -> visit_events)
7. checkin_validate (validasi GPS terhadap gps_radius_m outlet; VALID -> buat visits ber-status CHECKED_IN (dilindungi partial unique F1); INVALID -> INSERT visit_checkin_attempts status REJECTED untuk audit)

RACE CONDITION & LOCKING (wajib diterapkan di RPC):
- SJ: BEGIN; SELECT surat_jalan ... FOR UPDATE; SELECT surat_jalan_items ... FOR UPDATE; SELECT distributor_stock & sales_stock rows FOR UPDATE dengan URUTAN LOCK KONSISTEN (mis. ORDER BY id/product/outlet stabil); validasi final_qty & non-negatif; INSERT surat_jalan_stock_movements (diblokir unique bila sudah ada -> anti double); update balance; SET status COMPLETED; COMMIT.
- VISIT: BEGIN; SELECT visits ... FOR UPDATE; validasi status; SELECT sales_stock & outlet_stock rows FOR UPDATE dalam urutan konsisten; terapkan rumus stock_after; validasi quantity >= 0 (TIDAK BOLEH NEGATIF); INSERT visit_stock_movements (unique card+type -> anti double); update balances + ownership; tulis payments/receivables; INSERT transactions & transaction_items (snapshot, unique(transaction_id, visit_product_card_id) -> anti duplikasi); SET FINALIZED; COMMIT.
- Semua perhitungan stok dilakukan di dalam lock sehingga tidak ada negative stock, tidak ada double transfer, tidak ada partial stock movement; transaksi gagal = rollback penuh.

IDEMPOTENCY - proteksi TERPISAH per domain:
1. SJ: unique(surat_jalan_id, surat_jalan_item_id, movement_type) pada surat_jalan_stock_movements.
2. VISIT: unique(card_id, movement_type) pada visit_stock_movements.
3. TRANSACTION: unique(distributor_id, transaction_number) pada transactions; unique(transaction_id, visit_product_card_id) pada transaction_items.
4. ACTIVE VISIT: partial unique (distributor_id, sales_id) WHERE status IN ('DRAFT','CHECKED_IN') pada visits - [REQUIRES SQL IMPLEMENTATION] (F1).
(Dan unique (sj_number) per distributor, unique assignment aktif per outlet/sales, unique (surat_jalan_id, product_id) item.)

NEGATIVE STOCK PREVENTION - CHECK (quantity >= 0) pada distributor_stock, sales_stock, outlet_stock, dan seluruh kolom qty visit_product_cards yang relevan; semua juga divalidasi kembali di dalam RPC dengan FOR UPDATE.

SOURCE OF TRUTH vs SNAPSHOT (domain transaksi/payment/receivable) - TIDAK ADA DUA SUMBER KEBENARAN:
- condition    -> SATU-SATUNYA sumber: visit_product_cards.condition; TIDAK diulang di transaction_items.
- amount_due   -> sumber: visit_product_cards.amount_due (per kartu); transactions.total_amount & transaction_items.line_total = header/snapshot turunan, WAJIB rekonsiliasi dengan kartu.
- amount_paid  -> sumber: visit_payments (ledger penerimaan); nilai amount_paid di kartu dan transactions = agregasi/snapshot.
- receivable   -> sumber: visit_receivables (saldo piutang); receivable_amount di transactions = turunan (total_amount - amount_paid).
- stock qty    -> sumber: saldo terkunci (distributor_stock/sales_stock/outlet_stock) + movement ledger; nilai qty pada visit_product_cards = snapshot kejadian visit.

PAYMENT INVARIANT: amount_paid + receivable_amount = amount_due (per kartu; dan total_amount = amount_paid + receivable_amount pada header transaksi). Untuk transaksi wajib LUNAS: amount_paid = amount_due, receivable = 0.

BUCKET STORAGE: visit-photos (FOTO_PRODUK & FOTO_AKHIR), visit-documents (struk/nota/kwitansi/invoice/SJ), outlet-photos (FOTO_DEPAN_OUTLET). Semua private, tenant-scoped (folder distributor_id/...).

TIDAK ADA DELETE/DROP di domain bisnis; penonaktifan = status/ended_at; seluruh history append-only.
"